post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
Omdrop is installed. Each user who wants it runs, once:

  omdrop setup

That adds Omdrop to the bar and installs the receiver service. The radio
comes from a separate package: brcmfmac-awdl-dkms on an Apple Silicon Mac,
omdrop-owl on other Wi-Fi cards. `omdrop doctor` says what is missing.
MSG
}
